{"4460130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "INFINITY DEADLINE", "steam_appid": 4460130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/78012f3766043518f53c78aa2661dc0d.poster.avif?t=1774614797\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/78012f3766043518f53c78aa2661dc0d.webm?t=1774614797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/78012f3766043518f53c78aa2661dc0d.mp4?t=1774614797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>With only 5 minutes left until the deadline, the real nightmare has just begun.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Jian Xun, a 25-year-old scriptwriter drowning in deadline anxiety. Every time you wake up in your cramped, cyberpunk-style room, the piercing mechanical alarm clock is dead set at 11:55. This is not just high-pressure occupational anxiety; it's a life-and-death struggle for the dominance of consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/4a4fa13dbad9522811ea0f872ef680dd.poster.avif?t=1774614797\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/4a4fa13dbad9522811ea0f872ef680dd.webm?t=1774614797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/4a4fa13dbad9522811ea0f872ef680dd.mp4?t=1774614797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game progresses by alternating between &quot;Reality&quot; and &quot;Script.&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you simply follow the plot to get the job done. But soon, you'll discover that your computer document has gained self-awareness. Not only does it automatically correct your wording, but it also attempts to completely take over your creation. Faced with collapsing laws of physics and a ghost keyboard typing on its own, you must find clues to break the loop under extreme pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/15d449e4afd61215cca16146171e2aea.poster.avif?t=1774614797\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/15d449e4afd61215cca16146171e2aea.webm?t=1774614797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/15d449e4afd61215cca16146171e2aea.mp4?t=1774614797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Keyframe Sorting Gameplay&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this tug-of-war, obeying the rules is a dead end. Enter the computer screen and confront the system's challenges head-on. Obtain scattered &quot;keyframe silhouette fragments&quot; and drag them into the correct order through rigorous logical deduction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/f415d4de75e131c9e3fb77fc3684b505.poster.avif?t=1774614797\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/f415d4de75e131c9e3fb77fc3684b505.webm?t=1774614797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/f415d4de75e131c9e3fb77fc3684b505.mp4?t=1774614797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/ec2ef9c89a80d494d3a9980b4c2c47da.poster.avif?t=1774614797\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/ec2ef9c89a80d494d3a9980b4c2c47da.webm?t=1774614797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/ec2ef9c89a80d494d3a9980b4c2c47da.mp4?t=1774614797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover the Truth of the World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the false &quot;perfect morning&quot; arrives, you will touch upon the cruel secret at the bottom of the world: Are you really a living human who stumbled into a dream? Or are you merely &quot;painful sample data&quot; generated by an AI to simulate creativity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/12788b0f9981cd08aa4c4089d5db31e3.poster.avif?t=1774614797\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/12788b0f9981cd08aa4c4089d5db31e3.webm?t=1774614797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/12788b0f9981cd08aa4c4089d5db31e3.mp4?t=1774614797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/78012f3766043518f53c78aa2661dc0d.poster.avif?t=1774614797\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/78012f3766043518f53c78aa2661dc0d.webm?t=1774614797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/78012f3766043518f53c78aa2661dc0d.mp4?t=1774614797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>With only 5 minutes left until the deadline, the real nightmare has just begun.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Jian Xun, a 25-year-old scriptwriter drowning in deadline anxiety. Every time you wake up in your cramped, cyberpunk-style room, the piercing mechanical alarm clock is dead set at 11:55. This is not just high-pressure occupational anxiety; it's a life-and-death struggle for the dominance of consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/4a4fa13dbad9522811ea0f872ef680dd.poster.avif?t=1774614797\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/4a4fa13dbad9522811ea0f872ef680dd.webm?t=1774614797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/4a4fa13dbad9522811ea0f872ef680dd.mp4?t=1774614797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game progresses by alternating between &quot;Reality&quot; and &quot;Script.&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you simply follow the plot to get the job done. But soon, you'll discover that your computer document has gained self-awareness. Not only does it automatically correct your wording, but it also attempts to completely take over your creation. Faced with collapsing laws of physics and a ghost keyboard typing on its own, you must find clues to break the loop under extreme pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/15d449e4afd61215cca16146171e2aea.poster.avif?t=1774614797\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/15d449e4afd61215cca16146171e2aea.webm?t=1774614797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/15d449e4afd61215cca16146171e2aea.mp4?t=1774614797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Keyframe Sorting Gameplay&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this tug-of-war, obeying the rules is a dead end. Enter the computer screen and confront the system's challenges head-on. Obtain scattered &quot;keyframe silhouette fragments&quot; and drag them into the correct order through rigorous logical deduction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/f415d4de75e131c9e3fb77fc3684b505.poster.avif?t=1774614797\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/f415d4de75e131c9e3fb77fc3684b505.webm?t=1774614797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460130/extras/f415d4de75e131c9e3fb77fc3684b505.mp4?t=1774614797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"